<title>HONG KONG: Deutsche Bank HK places HK$ fixed rate CD.</title>
<headline>Deutsche Bank HK places HK$ fixed rate CD.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-01-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Deutsche Bank's Hong Kong branch has lodged a HK$100 million four-year fixed rate certificate of deposit issue with the Hong Kong Monetary Authority Central Moneymarkets Unit.</p>
<p>The certificates were priced at par and pay a coupon of 7.0 percent per annum.</p>
<p>The issue will mature on January 29, 2001.</p>
<p>Deutsche Bank Hong Kong branch is the paying agent.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6960</p>
</text>
